# 7. Capillary Pressure, Saturation Height Modeling (SHF) & SCAL

### 7.1 Leverett $J$-Function & 3D Static Model Initialization

To initialize continuous 3D water saturation in the static geological cellular model above the Free Water Level ($FWL = {{ "%.1f"|format(sw_params.fwl) }}\text{ m TVDss}$, Basis: `{{ sw_params.fwl_basis }}`), log-derived $S_w$ was reconciled with capillary pressure ($P_c$) curves via the Leverett $J$-Function:

$$h = TVD_{ss}(FWL) - TVD_{ss}, \quad P_c = \Delta\rho \cdot g \cdot h \cdot C, \quad J(S_w) = \frac{0.2166 \cdot P_c}{\sigma \cos\theta} \sqrt{\frac{K}{\phi}}, \quad S_{w,SHF} = a_J \cdot J^{b_J}$$

* **Interfacial Tension & Wettability:** $\sigma \cos\theta = {{ "%.1f"|format(shf_params.ift_cos_theta) }}\text{ dynes/cm}$ ($\sigma = {{ shf_params.ift }}\text{ dynes/cm}$, $\theta = {{ shf_params.theta }}^\circ$).
* **Fluid Density Gradient:** $\rho_w = {{ shf_params.gw }}\text{ g/cc}$, $\rho_{hc} = {{ shf_params.ghc }}\text{ g/cc}$ ($\Delta\rho = {{ "%.2f"|format(shf_params.gw - shf_params.ghc) }}\text{ g/cc}$).
* **Log $S_w$ vs. $SHF$ Reconciliation:** Mean RMSE $= {{ "%.3f"|format(shf_params.reconciliation_rmse) }}\text{ v/v}$, Mean Bias ($S_w - SHF$) $= {{ "%+.3f"|format(shf_params.reconciliation_bias) }}\text{ v/v}$.

